<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 8/9.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 8/9.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Tuesday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 8/9. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     July 8/9	 July 7/8</p>
<p>    CZK    0.43203	 0.43285</p>
<p>    DKK    2.1004	  2.10041</p>
<p>    FIM    2.68772	 2.68658</p>
<p>    GBP   23.73589	23.50398</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07443	 0.0743 </p>
<p>    LTL    3.5105	  3.48719</p>
<p>    LVL   24.63293	24.51763</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00234	 0.241  </p>
<p>    SEK    1.8078	  1.81062</p>
<p>    UAH    7.57185	 7.51517</p>
<p>    USD   14.042	  13.9444 </p>
<p>    XEU   15.74319	15.73695</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
